WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.600
Hi, I'm Jason, just popping in for a quick hello!

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.900
Thanks for checking out my resume.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.900
I saw your job posting, it's exactly the type
of posting I was looking for,

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.000
and I wanted to try and stand out.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.200
So, I created a little interactive AI resume app

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.800
with some functionality like emailing a resume,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.300
transferring this call, or scheduling an interview.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.200
Check it out.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.000
Thanks again, and I hope we talk soon.
